```bat
git remote rename origin upstream
git remote add origin https://github.com/ppiiyo/livecut-en.git
git add -A
git commit -m "EN GTA6 edition: English AI output, EN top-4 channels, TikTok+Shorts tags"
git push -u origin main
```

